{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Congratulations, you're finally a Frontiersman! You're being sent on a special assignment- to venture out into the wild unknown and aid a diverse community of colorful characters. <strong>You must establish a farm, breed your friends, and fight against evildoers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/dc58fd3819cb7e9022041883642bea7e.poster.avif?t=1766582174\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/dc58fd3819cb7e9022041883642bea7e.webm?t=1766582174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/dc58fd3819cb7e9022041883642bea7e.mp4?t=1766582174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not everything is sunshine and rainbows though, poachers are disturbing the natural ecosystem of the frontiers you have sworn to protect. <strong>Team up with your monsterfolk partners to fight back those who seek to exploit the land on behalf of their own greed.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/096b721a66898e33d19c83d2ff42445c.poster.avif?t=1766582174\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/096b721a66898e33d19c83d2ff42445c.webm?t=1766582174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/096b721a66898e33d19c83d2ff42445c.mp4?t=1766582174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equal parts farming simulator &amp; turn-based RPG, there's always something new around the corner! Here are just a few of the things you can do in Cloud Meadow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultivate A Cozy Farm-</strong> plant seeds, grow crops, take charge of your personal homestead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle Baddies-</strong> engage in satisfying hybrid active-turn-based RPG battles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sexual Shenanigans-</strong> breed and bond with your colleagues! Over 50 animated sex scenes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Customization-</strong> cooking, party customization, farm upgrades! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/6d3cf0160bbfb628620710deaf907128.poster.avif?t=1766582174\" width=1170 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/6d3cf0160bbfb628620710deaf907128.webm?t=1766582174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/extras/6d3cf0160bbfb628620710deaf907128.mp4?t=1766582174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1223750?t=1766582174","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766582174","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766582174","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1223750/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766582174","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Trading